},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_5","text":"The ones who are calling the shots.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_6","text":"This means in addition to the sheer size of the attacking force, there were high-class Raptures amongst their ranks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_7","text":"This was all meticulously planned from the beginning. They had all their ducks in a row before they attacked.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_8","text":"Are we to presume they came for the Grimms model?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_9","text":"That would be safe to assume, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_intermission_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_intermission_01_10","text":"The facility is in ruins.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"sho